# Shell scripts run inside Linux containers regardless of which OS checked
# them out -- a CRLF-converted entrypoint.sh (core.autocrlf=true on a fresh
# Windows clone, the default here) breaks its shebang line the moment
# `docker build` copies it into the image. Force LF unconditionally rather
# than relying on every contributor's local autocrlf setting.
*.sh text eol=lf
